---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import StackLayers from '../components/StackLayers.astro';
import AgentLoop from '../components/AgentLoop.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About - Bhavyaveer" description="About Bhavyaveer and the systems, tools, and technologies he works with.">
  <section class="grid gap-10 border-b border-ink px-6 py-10 md:grid-cols-[280px_1fr] md:px-10 md:py-14">
    <img src="/images/me.jpg" alt="Bhavyaveer" class="aspect-square w-full border border-ink object-cover" />
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink/50">About me</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold md:text-6xl">Hi, I'm Bhavyaveer.</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-prose text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
        I'm an AI engineer who loves exploring how technology can solve real-world problems. 
        My learning journey has taken me across quite a few fascinating domains, 
        from artificial intelligence and cybersecurity to web development and system design. 
        I’ve always believed that real growth happens when you challenge yourself to learn 
        something completely new, and that’s the approach I bring to everything I do.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-7 flex w-full flex-wrap gap-4 sm:w-auto">
        <a
          href="https://leetcode.com/u/ouVzXXzr/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 inline-flex justify-center border border-ink px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold transition-colors hover:border-vermilion hover:text-vermilion sm:flex-initial"
        >
          LeetCode profile ↗
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Bhavyaveer44"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-1 inline-flex justify-center border border-ink px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold transition-colors hover:border-vermilion hover:text-vermilion sm:flex-initial"
        >
          GitHub profile ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-8 md:px-10 md:py-12">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">
      <!-- Left Column: Heading + Content -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
        <SectionHeading title="What I do & what I'm building"/>
        
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-prose text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
          I build AI-powered software, focusing primarily on agentic systems: 
          LLMs that plan, call tools, and coordinate with each other to complete complex workflows. 
          That spans across full-stack applications, robust backends, and the core model layer.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-6 max-w-prose text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
          Beyond web apps, I’m going deeper into the systems and evaluation side of AI:
        </p>

        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 max-w-prose text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
          <li>A multi-provider LLM gateway in Go, featuring caching, routing, and rate limiting.</li>
          <li>An evaluation harness for regression-testing prompts.</li>
          <li>An MLOps pipeline for fraud detection.</li>
          <li>A voice-driven AI agent.</li>
          <li>An AI powered vocabulary vault.</li>
          <li>A sandboxed online code-execution service.</li>
          <li>A CI/CD for a microservices app</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Agent Loop aligned to top -->
      <div>
        <AgentLoop />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-8 md:px-10 md:py-12">
    <SectionHeading title="Tech Stack"/>
    <StackLayers />
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-8 md:px-10 md:py-12">
    <SectionHeading title="Outside the code"/>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-prose text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
        Away from the terminal, I channel creativity into producing trap beats, capturing landscape photography, and experimenting with cooking. 
        To keep my mind sharp, I enjoy reading books and solving complex puzzles. I also study financial systems and robotics, 
        play football, and travel to gain fresh perspectives. 
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>